MODULE: BaselineOnlyAfterRepairBaselineFirst
TARGET: BaselineOnlyAfterRepair
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: A probe certifies a fingerprint without completing repair.
PERTURBS: ProbeChunk
--- FIND
    /\ UNCHANGED <<phase, baseline, fingerprint, repaired, probeOnly, pending,
                   demand, servingDemand, sweeps, pump, armNeeded, busy,
                   selected, failureUsed>>
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: bank the probe instead of the completed repair.
    /\ baseline' = fingerprint
    /\ UNCHANGED <<phase, fingerprint, repaired, probeOnly, pending,
                   demand, servingDemand, sweeps, pump, armNeeded, busy,
                   selected, failureUsed>>
--- END
